      "message": "Why can\u0027t this just be:\n\n    if (upstreamIfIndex !\u003d NO_UPSTREAM) {\n\n? How can it happen that upstreamIfIndex !\u003d 0 but upstreamIface is null? It seems like this is impossible: upstreamIfIndex comes from calling getInterfaceParams on upstreamIface, and if that\u0027s null it can never return nonzero.",
