      "writtenOn": "2023-09-01T07:21:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s a bit confusing that we have different interface indices depending on whether the upstream supports BPF or not.\n\nWould it make sense to have something like:\n\n    private int getInterfaceIndexForRule(int ifindex) {\n        return mUpstreamSupportsBpf ? ifindex : 0;\n    }\n\nThat we could call here and in line 903?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 923,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 923,
        "endChar": 77
